# game/week8.rpy:11
translate indonesian week8_start_4b45e772:

    # n "The heavy hum of the evening fan in your boarding house room did little to clear the thick, looping thoughts running through your head."
    n  "Dengung berat kipas angin malam di kamar kosmu tak mampu mengusir kusutnya pikiran yang terus berputar-putar di kepalamu."

# game/week8.rpy:12
translate indonesian week8_start_c140181a:

    # n "It had been an entire week since that suffocating afternoon in civics class, and the space between you and Trida had felt oddly hollow ever since."
    n  "Sudah seminggu penuh berlalu sejak sore yang menyesakkan di kelas PPKn itu, dan ruang hampa di antara kamu dan Trida terasa begitu janggal semenjak saat itu."

# game/week8.rpy:13
translate indonesian week8_start_f0d16eb0:

    # n "Even though you shared classes, they had masterfully dodged eye contact, slipped out of rooms before you could catch up, and kept their usual bright, frantic chatter locked tightly away behind a guarded, quiet smile."
    n  "Meskipun kalian berbagi ruang kelas yang sama, ia dengan lihai selalu menghindari kontak mata, menyelinap keluar ruangan sebelum kamu sempat menyusul, dan mengunci rapat-rapat celotehan cerianya yang biasa di balik senyuman dingin yang penuh jarak."

# game/week8.rpy:15
translate indonesian week8_start_1650ebc7:

    # n "You were sitting on the edge of your bed, staring blankly at your phone screen as you replayed that awful silence over and over, when a sudden, sharp rapping echoed against your room door."
    n  "Kamu tengah duduk di tepi ranjang, menatap nanar layar ponselmu sembari memutar ulang keheningan menyakitkan itu berulang-ulang, ketika tiba-tiba ketukan pintu yang tajam dan tergesa memecah kesunyian kamarmu."

# game/week8.rpy:18
translate indonesian week8_start_1c3e0e5a:

    # n "Frowning, you pushed yourself up and pulled the door open, expecting the building manager or a neighbour. Instead, your breath caught."
    n  "Sambil mengernyitkan dahi, kamu beranjak bangun dan membuka pintu, mengira itu ibu kos atau tetangga sebelah. Namun saat pintu terbuka, napasmu mendadak tercekat."

# game/week8.rpy:22
translate indonesian week8_start_9159c8f2:

    # n "Standing in the dim hallway light was Trida. They looked a little worn out, and they offered a painfully hesitant, tight-lipped smile that didn't quite reach their eyes."
    n  "Berdiri di temaramnya cahaya lampu lorong adalah Trida. Wajahnya tampak kuyu dan lelah, memperlihatkan seulas senyum kaku yang getir dan sama sekali tak sampai ke matanya."

# game/week8.rpy:23
translate indonesian week8_start_6fc5a849:

    # n "Their hands were shoved deep into their front pocket, nervously fidgeting with the fabric."
    n  "Kedua tangannya terbenam dalam-dalam di saku saku depan hoodie-nya, jemarinya meremas-remas kain dengan gelisah."

# game/week8.rpy:25
translate indonesian week8_start_dd8919ff:

    # trida "Um... hey,"
    trida  "Um... hai,"

# game/week8.rpy:26
translate indonesian week8_start_da5f8b6c:

    # n "They started, their voice softer and more guarded than usual as they shifted their weight from one foot to the other."
    n  "Ia membuka suara, nadanya terdengar jauh lebih lirih dan penuh kehati-hatian dibanding biasanya seraya memindahkan tumpuan kakinya kikuk."

# game/week8.rpy:27
translate indonesian week8_start_d7b66427:

    # trida "Is this... is this a bad time? I can come back later if you're busy or anything."
    trida  "Ini... lagi ganggu waktu istirahatmu nggak? Aku bisa balik lagi nanti kalau kamu lagi sibuk atau ada urusan."

# game/week8.rpy:29
translate indonesian week8_start_c862d0bf:

    # n "Instantly, a spike of worry cut through your surprise. Before they could even pull their hands away to retreat, you shook your head and stepped back, pulling the door wide open."
    n  "Rasa cemas seketika menepis keterkejutanmu. Sebelum ia sempat menarik diri untuk berbalik pergi, kamu menggelengkan kepala dan melangkah mundur, membuka pintu kamarmu lebar-lebar."

# game/week8.rpy:30
translate indonesian week8_start_238a075a:

    # p "No, it's not a bad time. Come on in."
    p  "Nggak, sama sekali nggak ganggu kok. Masuk aja."

# game/week8.rpy:31
translate indonesian week8_start_b608b557:

    # n "You said, your tone dropping any trace of hesitation as you gestured for them to come inside."
    n  "Ucapmu tegas tanpa sedikit pun keraguan, memberi isyarat agar ia melangkah masuk ke dalam."

# game/week8.rpy:34
translate indonesian week8_start_e75c1c44:

    # n "Trida blinked, clearly startled that you let them in so easily, but they stepped across the threshold with quiet, cautious movements."
    n  "Trida mengerjap, tampak kaget kamu mengizinkannya masuk dengan begitu mudah, namun ia tetap melangkah melewati ambang pintu dengan gerakan pelan dan penuh kehati-hatian."

# game/week8.rpy:35
translate indonesian week8_start_9dd52f43:

    # n "They didn't linger by the desk or pace around as they normally did; instead, they walked straight over to the small lounge area in your boarding house and sat on the edge of the couch, pulling their knees up slightly and looking entirely too small."
    n  "Ia tidak berkeliling melihat mejamu atau mondar-mandir seperti kebiasaannya; sebaliknya, ia langsung melangkah menuju area santai kecil di kamar kosmu dan duduk di tepi sofa, menarik kedua lututnya merapat dan terlihat begitu rapuh serta kecil."

# game/week8.rpy:38
translate indonesian week8_start_a0aed35b:

    # n "The small lounge area felt entirely too quiet, the steady hum of the small wall-mounted air conditioner serving as the only background noise against the heavy, palpable tension in the air."
    n  "Area santai kecil itu terasa teramat sunyi; dengung stabil dari pendingin ruangan di dinding menjadi satu-satunya suara pengisi hening di tengah pekatnya ketegangan yang menggantung di udara."

# game/week8.rpy:39
translate indonesian week8_start_c15d71f1:

    # n "Trida sat rigidly on the edge of the worn fabric couch, their posture tightly coiled and defensive."
    n  "Trida duduk membeku di tepian sofa kain yang telah usang, postur tubuhnya melengkung kaku dan begitu defensif."

# game/week8.rpy:40
translate indonesian week8_start_540c5a97:

    # n "They had pulled their knees up slightly, arms wrapped defensively across the oversized fabric of their hoodie, fingers clutching at the opposite sleeves as if trying to hold themselves together physically."
    n  "Ia menarik sedikit kedua lututnya, mendekap tubuhnya rapat-rapat di balik hoodie kebesarannya, jemarinya mencengkeram erat ujung lengan baju yang berlawanan seolah berusaha menahan dirinya agar tidak runtuh."

# game/week8.rpy:42
translate indonesian week8_start_bfd36b18:

    # n "You sat down on the opposite end of the small sofa, leaving a respectful buffer of space so they wouldn't feel cornered, though you angled your body toward them."
    n  "Kamu mendudukkan diri di ujung sofa yang berlawanan, menyisakan jarak yang cukup agar ia tidak merasa terpojok, meski tubuhmu condong menghadap ke arahnya."

# game/week8.rpy:43
translate indonesian week8_start_45d60ab2:

    # p "Relax, Trida, it's alright…"
    p  "Santai aja, Trida, nggak apa-apa kok..."

# game/week8.rpy:44
translate indonesian week8_start_001985db:

    # n "You said gently, when your voice came out soft and steady."
    n  "Ucapmu lembut, membiarkan suaramu mengalun tenang dan menyejukkan."

# game/week8.rpy:45
translate indonesian week8_start_3dec956c:

    # p "You're sitting like a statue… Kick your shoes off, and just get comfortable."
    p  "Kamu duduk kaku banget kayak patung gitu... Copot sepatumu, duduk yang nyaman aja."

# game/week8.rpy:47
translate indonesian week8_start_6f332a42:

    # n "Trida let out a dry, self-deprecating laugh that sounded more like an exhausted sigh."
    n  "Trida melepaskan tawa getir yang terdengar lebih mirip helaan napas putus asa."

# game/week8.rpy:48
translate indonesian week8_start_1fd3e26f:

    # n "They made a weak, half-hearted attempt to uncoil their posture, letting their feet drop to the floor, but their shoulders remained locked up near their ears."
    n  "Ia berusaha sedikit merilekskan tubuhnya dengan menurunkan kakinya ke lantai, namun kedua pundaknya masih tetap menegang kaku di dekat telinganya."

# game/week8.rpy:49
translate indonesian week8_start_aeed4026:

    # n "Their gaze bounced restlessly around your room—flickering over your desk, the posters on the wall, the edge of the rug—anything to avoid locking eyes with you directly for more than a split second."
    n  "Tatapannya bergerak gelisah menyapu kamarmu—berpindah dari mejamu, poster di dinding, hingga tepian karpet—mencari apa saja demi menghindari kontak mata langsung denganmu lebih dari sedetik."

# game/week8.rpy:50
translate indonesian week8_start_ba3b0db9:

    # n "The nervous twitch in their fingers didn't stop; their thumbs kept nervously rubbing against the cuffs of their sleeves."
    n  "Kedutan cemas di jemarinya tak kunjung reda; kedua ibu jarinya terus menggesek-gesek ujung manset lengan bajunya dengan gugup."

# game/week8.rpy:52
translate indonesian week8_start_dc477a63:

    # trida "Yeah, sorry…"
    trida  "Iya, maaf ya..."

# game/week8.rpy:53
translate indonesian week8_start_bc028f0f:

    # n "Trida murmured, making their voice sound brittle and entirely stripped of its usual brightness."
    n  "Trida bergumam lirih, nada suaranya terdengar begitu rapuh dan kehilangan seluruh keceriaannya yang biasa."

# game/week8.rpy:54
translate indonesian week8_start_0d5caf7e:

    # trida "I guess... I guess old habits die hard. Sitting still is kind of terrifying when your brain won't shut off."
    trida  "Kayaknya... kebiasaan lama susah hilangnya ya. Duduk diam begini rasanya menakutkan banget pas isi kepala nggak mau berhenti berputar."

# game/week8.rpy:56
translate indonesian week8_start_2ff664d3:

    # n "You shifted closer, making the cushions dip slightly under your weight, bridging a bit of the distance between you."
    n  "Kamu bergeser mendekat, membuat bantalan sofa sedikit melesak di bawah beban tubuhmu, memangkas sebagian jarak di antara kalian berdua."

# game/week8.rpy:57
translate indonesian week8_start_b714002e:

    # n "The worry pooling in your chest deepened, seeing how raw and fragile they still looked a full week after that civics class disaster."
    n  "Rasa cemas yang mengendap di dadamu kian membuncah, melihat betapa ia masih tampak begitu terluka dan rapuh seminggu penuh setelah insiden memalukan di kelas PPKn itu."

# game/week8.rpy:58
translate indonesian week8_start_b008a854:

    # p "Trida,"
    p  "Trida,"

# game/week8.rpy:59
translate indonesian week8_start_66c9d9fd:

    # n "You tried to keep your tone warm and completely devoid of any pressure."
    n  "Kamu berusaha menjaga nada bicaramu tetap hangat dan sama sekali bebas dari tekanan."

# game/week8.rpy:60
translate indonesian week8_start_91a9b3bc:

    # p "I know you didn't just show up here out of nowhere on a Saturday evening just to talk about nothing."
    p  "Aku tahu kamu nggak mungkin tiba-tiba datang ke sini di malam Minggu cuma buat basa-basi nggak jelas."

# game/week8.rpy:61
translate indonesian week8_start_26fe2f30:

    # p "You've been dodging me all week, and you've barely said two words…"
    p  "Seminggu ini kamu selalu ngehindar dariku, dan kamu hampir nggak ngomong sepatah kata pun..."

# game/week8.rpy:62
translate indonesian week8_start_a4eb938e:

    # p "What's actually going on in that head of yours? You can tell me."
    p  "Sebenarnya ada apa di dalam kepalamu? Cerita aja ke aku."

# game/week8.rpy:64
translate indonesian week8_start_57bed906:

    # n "At the direct invitation to open up, the defensive scaffolding Trida had spent the last seven days desperately trying to construct suddenly fractured."
    n  "Mendengar ajakan tulus untuk terbuka itu, benteng pertahanan yang setengah mati dibangun Trida selama tujuh hari terakhir seketika retak."

# game/week8.rpy:65
translate indonesian week8_start_3be83d38:

    # n "Their breath caught in their throat, making a sharp hitch that visibly rattled their frame."
    n  "Napasnya tercekat di tenggorokan, tersengal tajam hingga sekujur tubuhnya bergetar nyata."

# game/week8.rpy:66
translate indonesian week8_start_bd1abc9f:

    # n "Trida closed their eyes tightly for a brief moment, their jaws working as they swallowed hard against a sudden wave of emotion."
    n  "Trida memejamkan matanya rapat-rapat untuk sesaat, rahangnya mengatup kuat menelan ludah melawan gelombang emosi yang tiba-tiba meluap."

# game/week8.rpy:67
translate indonesian week8_start_6ac1e726:

    # n "When they opened them again, the restless bouncing of their gaze stopped, locking onto a random spot on the wall."
    n  "Saat ia membuka matanya kembali, tatapannya tak lagi bergerak liar; pandangannya terkunci lurus pada sebuah titik acak di dinding kamar."

# game/week8.rpy:69
translate indonesian week8_start_852c2325:

    # n "A long, trembling sigh slipped past their lips. Their breath was visibly unsteady, shuddering softly in the quiet air of the room as the heavy weight of everything they had been holding back finally began to press down on them."
    n  "Helaan napas panjang yang gemetar lolos dari bibirnya. Tarikan napasnya bergetar pelan di keheningan kamar saat beban berat yang selama ini ia pendam sendirian akhirnya mulai tumpah ruah."

# game/week8.rpy:70
translate indonesian week8_start_e8cfcd3f:

    # n "Trida stared down at their hands, their thumbs anxiously digging into the fabric of their sleeves. When they finally spoke, the sound was barely more than a cracked whisper, stripped entirely of its usual confidence."
    n  "Trida menunduk menatap kedua tangannya, ibu jarinya meremas kain lengan bajunya dengan cemas. Ketika ia akhirnya bersuara, ucapannya nyaris tak lebih dari bisikan parau yang hancur, kehilangan seluruh rasa percaya diri."

# game/week8.rpy:72
translate indonesian week8_start_6799c9bc:

    # trida "Every time I close my eyes, I just... I keep hearing what he said."
    trida  "Tiap kali aku merem, aku cuma... aku cuma terus denger kata-kata cowok itu."

# game/week8.rpy:73
translate indonesian week8_start_bca799f2:

    # n "They mumbled, their voice wavering violently. They let out a wet, shaky laugh, a pathetic sound meant to deflect, but the tears welling up in their eyes completely betrayed it."
    n  "Ia bergumam dengan suara yang bergetar hebat. Ia melepaskan tawa getir yang basah, suara memilukan yang berniat menutupi luka, namun genangan air mata yang mulai membendung di pelupuk matanya membongkar segalanya."

# game/week8.rpy:74
translate indonesian week8_start_fa611973:

    # trida "It's stupid, right? It was just some throwaway comment from a guy who couldn't even care less about me. But... he was right."
    trida  "Konyol banget kan ya? Padahal itu cuma celetukan asal dari cowok yang bahkan nggak peduli sama sekali sama aku. Tapi... omongan dia bener."

# game/week8.rpy:76
translate indonesian week8_start_5a9a60f8:

    # n "You shifted closer on the couch, with your chest tightening."
    n  "Kamu bergeser semakin merapat di sofa, dadamu berdenyut nyeri."

# game/week8.rpy:77
translate indonesian week8_start_8ef4b955:

    # p "Trida, he wasn't right. He was just being an asshole."
    p  "Trida, omongan dia nggak bener sama sekali. Dia itu cuma orang brengsek yang nggak punya empati."

# game/week8.rpy:80
translate indonesian week8_start_522ea454:

    # trida "No, he {i}was{/i} right!"
    trida  "Nggak, omongan dia itu {i}bener{/i}!"

# game/week8.rpy:81
translate indonesian week8_start_04560913:

    # n "Trida suddenly snapped, their voice cracking sharply as the fragile barrier they'd built all week finally shattered."
    n  "Trida mendadak meninggikan suaranya, suaranya tercekat parau saat benteng kerapuhan yang ia bangun sepanjang minggu akhirnya hancur lebur."

# game/week8.rpy:82
translate indonesian week8_start_0791d0b8:

    # n "They turned to look at you, their eyes swimming with tears, the raw, unfiltered devastation on their face making it hard to breathe."
    n  "Ia menoleh menatapmu dengan mata yang dibanjiri air mata; kehancuran batin yang terlukis murni dan tanpa sekat di wajahnya membuatmu tercekat sulit bernapas."

# game/week8.rpy:83
translate indonesian week8_start_0abee992:

    # trida "I {i}am{/i} dead weight! I mess up every basic thing, I can't even open a file or follow a simple instruction without turning into a total clown, and the second things get real, I just freeze up!"
    trida  "Aku ini {i}emang{/i} cuma beban! Semua hal dasar selalu kubikin kacau, buka file atau ngikutin instruksi sederhana aja aku gagal sampai kelihatan kayak badut tolol, dan begitu situasinya serius, aku cuma bisa mematung kaku!"

# game/week8.rpy:85
translate indonesian week8_start_77d68926:

    # n "They pulled their knees up to their chest, burying their face against their arms for a second as a harsh, ragged sob hitched in their throat."
    n  "Ia menarik kedua lututnya merapat ke dada, menyembunyikan wajahnya di balik kedua lengan saat isak tangis yang kasar dan tersengal-sengal lolos dari tenggorokannya."

# game/week8.rpy:86
translate indonesian week8_start_69d08eed:

    # n "When they lifted their head back up, their cheeks were wet, and their expression was twisted with crushing self-loathing."
    n  "Ketika ia mengangkat kepalanya kembali, kedua pipinya telah basah kuyup oleh air mata, dan ekspresinya terdistorsi oleh rasa benci mendalam pada dirinya sendiri."

# game/week8.rpy:87
translate indonesian week8_start_70d3b08f:

    # trida "Remember when I said I wanted to make people smile? Wanted to be someone who actually helped?"
    trida  "Kamu ingat kan pas aku bilang pengin bikin orang tersenyum? Pengin jadi orang yang beneran bisa ngebantu orang lain?"

# game/week8.rpy:88
translate indonesian week8_start_8d2bd73e:

    # n "A bitter and broken laugh was slipping slowly like a downpour."
    n  "Sebuah tawa getir dan hancur meluncur pelan laksana guyuran hujan lebat."

# game/week8.rpy:89
translate indonesian week8_start_3a84f38e:

    # trida "It's a joke. It's all just... me running away from how useless I feel. Before I moved here, I struggled with my art classes back home."
    trida  "Itu semua lelucon konyol. Itu semua cuma... caraku lari dari kenyataan betapa nggak gunanya aku ini. Sebelum pindah ke sini, aku selalu kesusahan ikut kelas seni rupa di kampung halamanku."

# game/week8.rpy:90
translate indonesian week8_start_b5a68e9c:

    # trida "My teachers looked at me the same way—sighing, shaking their heads, and wondering why I even bothered trying when I had no natural talent."
    trida  "Guru-guruku dulu menatapku dengan cara yang persis sama—menghela napas lelah, menggelengkan kepala, dan bertanya-tanya ngapain juga aku repot-repot nyoba kalau emang nggak punya bakat alami."

# game/week8.rpy:91
translate indonesian week8_start_75eb027d:

    # trida "I spent years telling myself, 'At least you're optimistic! At least you keep the mood light!' But what's the point?"
    trida  "Bertahun-tahun aku ngebohongi diriku sendiri, 'Seenggaknya kamu optimis! Seenggaknya kamu bisa bikin suasana ceria!' Tapi apa gunanya coba?"

# game/week8.rpy:93
translate indonesian week8_start_311678c7:

    # n "Their voice dropped into a defeated whisper, the fight completely drained out of them."
    n  "Suaranya merosot menjadi bisikan yang putus asa, seluruh daya juangnya luruh tak bersisa."

# game/week8.rpy:94
translate indonesian week8_start_c8e2d006:

    # trida "When you're cheerful all the time, people just think you're stupid. And the second you crash out... you realise you don't actually have anything else."
    trida  "Kalau kamu ceria terus tiap saat, orang-orang cuma bakal nganggep kamu bodoh. Dan begitu kamu hancur terpuruk... kamu baru sadar kalau kamu nggak punya apa-apa lagi selain itu."

# game/week8.rpy:95
translate indonesian week8_start_c5fffdbb:

    # trida "I'm just loud, and clumsy, and completely incapable of doing anything right. Sometimes... honestly? Sometimes I seriously wonder why I even try. Why do I have such high hopes when every single time, I just end up proving everyone right about me?"
    trida  "Aku ini cuma berisik, ceroboh, dan bener-bener nggak bisa ngerjain apa pun dengan bener. Kadang... jujur aja? Kadang aku bener-bener mikir buat apa aku terus berusaha. Kenapa aku harus punya impian setinggi langit kalau ujung-ujungnya, aku cuma ngebuktiin kalau omongan mereka tentang diriku itu bener?"

# game/week8.rpy:97
translate indonesian week8_start_5fb0dc67:

    # n "The rawness of their confession hung heavy in the air, the silence of the room filled only by the soft, uneven sound of Trida's breathing."
    n  "Kepedihan dari pengakuan jujurnya menggantung begitu berat di udara; keheningan kamar hanya diisi oleh suara napas Trida yang memburu dan tak beraturan."

# game/week8.rpy:98
translate indonesian week8_start_13d3cd0b:

    # n "Without a second thought, you shifted closer on the couch, closing the remaining distance between you until your shoulder pressed firmly against theirs."
    n  "Tanpa ragu sedetik pun, kamu bergeser semakin merapat di sofa, menghapus sisa jarak di antara kalian hingga bahumu menempel erat di samping bahunya."

# game/week8.rpy:99
translate indonesian week8_start_dbd8f27c:

    # n "You reached out, offering a grounding hand to grip their arm."
    n  "Kamu mengulurkan tanganmu, mencengkeram lembut lengannya untuk memberinya sandaran yang kokoh."

# game/week8.rpy:101
translate indonesian week8_start_2b8bb497:

    # p "Look at me, Trida."
    p  "Lihat aku, Trida."

# game/week8.rpy:106
translate indonesian week8_start_6787853d:

    # n "Slowly your hands took Trida's fingers as both of your skin brushed against each other, making a little shudder through their hands."
    n  "Perlahan tanganmu menggenggam jemari Trida saat kulit kalian bersentuhan, menghantarkan getaran halus yang menjalar menenangkan tangannya."

# game/week8.rpy:107
translate indonesian week8_start_44bb3ce2:

    # n "Your voice was firm with deep earnestness, and stripped of any hesitation."
    n  "Suaramu terdengar mantap penuh ketulusan mendalam, tanpa menyisakan secuil pun keraguan."

# game/week8.rpy:108
translate indonesian week8_start_cc1225fd:

    # n "It took a moment, but Trida slowly raised their head, their tear-filled eyes blinking in surprise as they met your gaze."
    n  "Butuh beberapa detik, namun Trida perlahan mengangkat kepalanya; matanya yang basah oleh air mata mengerjap kaget saat bersitatap dengan pandanganmu."

# game/week8.rpy:110
translate indonesian week8_start_671d56a5:

    # p "You are not useless."
    p  "Kamu sama sekali bukan orang yang nggak berguna."

# game/week8.rpy:111
translate indonesian week8_start_a3fda879:

    # n "You said softly, letting every word carry absolute conviction."
    n  "Ucapmu lembut, membiarkan setiap untaian kata membawa keyakinan mutlak."

# game/week8.rpy:112
translate indonesian week8_start_40f754af:

    # p "The way you talk about yourself... None of that is true. You think you're just a clown or a distraction, but you have no idea how much light you actually bring into a room."
    p  "Semua hal buruk yang kamu omongin tentang dirimu barusan... nggak ada satu pun yang bener. Kamu mikir kamu cuma badut atau pengacau, padahal kamu nggak tahu seberapa banyak kehangatan dan keceriaan yang kamu bawa ke dalam ruangan."

# game/week8.rpy:113
translate indonesian week8_start_28d2c33e:

    # p "You make people smile, and you've made me so genuinely happy just by being around. Your optimism isn't a fake mask—it's who you are, and it's wonderful."
    p  "Kamu bikin orang lain tersenyum, dan kehadiranmu selalu bikin aku ngerasa bahagia yang tulus. Sifat optimismu itu bukan topeng palsu—itu jati dirimu yang sebenarnya, dan itu hal yang luar biasa indah."

# game/week8.rpy:114
translate indonesian week8_start_66a98e48:

    # p "You care so much about everyone else, and it kills me to see you beat yourself up over one miserable guy who doesn't even know you."
    p  "Kamu begitu peduli sama semua orang, dan rasanya sakit banget melihatmu menyiksa dirimu sendiri cuma gara-gara satu orang picik yang bahkan nggak kenal siapa dirimu sebenarnya."

# game/week8.rpy:116
translate indonesian week8_start_5b0ca3c1:

    # n "You squeezed their arm gently, holding their gaze."
    n  "Kamu meremas lembut lengannya, mengunci tatapannya lekat-lekat."

# game/week8.rpy:117
translate indonesian week8_start_b26a284c:

    # p "You're talented, you're resilient, and you are so much more than a few bad moments in a classroom. I care about you, Trida. Please don't ever think you're alone in this, or that you aren't enough."
    p  "Kamu berbakat, kamu kuat, dan dirimu jauh lebih berharga daripada segelintir momen buruk di dalam kelas. Aku peduli banget sama kamu, Trida. Tolong jangan pernah mikir kalau kamu sendirian menanggung semua ini, atau ngerasa kalau dirimu nggak pantas."

# game/week8.rpy:119
translate indonesian week8_start_876452d5:

    # n "The words hit Trida like a physical wave. For a second, they completely stopped breathing, their lips parting slightly as the profound weight of genuine, unconditional validation washed over them."
    n  "Kata-katamu menghantam sanubari Trida laksana gelombang kehangatan yang nyata. Untuk sedetik, napasnya tercekat berhenti, bibirnya sedikit terbuka saat pengakuan tulus tanpa syarat itu menyelimuti seluruh relung hatinya."

# game/week8.rpy:120
translate indonesian week8_start_4d8ff5f8:

    # n "They looked like someone standing out in the cold who had suddenly found a hearth fire. It had been so long—perhaps years—since anyone had spoken to them with such fierce, unreserved kindness, seeing past all their noise and catching them when they fell."
    n  "Ia tampak seperti musafir yang kedinginan di tengah badai dan tiba-tiba menemukan perapian hangat. Sudah begitu lama—mungkin bertahun-tahun—sejak terakhir kali ada seseorang yang berbicara padanya dengan kelembutan yang begitu tulus dan gigih, melihat menembus segala kebisingannya dan merengkuhnya saat ia terjatuh."

# game/week8.rpy:121
translate indonesian week8_start_5f64ff23:

    # n "A fresh swell of emotion hit them, but this time, the heavy, crushing despair began to dissolve, replaced by a sudden, overwhelming rush of warmth."
    n  "Gelombang emosi baru kembali menerpanya, namun kali ini kepedihan yang menindih perlahan mencair, berganti kehangatan luar biasa yang meluap memenuhi dadanya."

# game/week8.rpy:125
translate indonesian week8_start_5ede69f2:

    # n "A watery chuckle slipped past Trida's lips, and despite the fresh tears still tracking down their flushed cheeks, a wide, genuine grin broke across their face—radiant, messy, and entirely disarming."
    n  "Tawa kecil yang basah lolos dari bibir Trida, dan di tengah lelehan air mata yang masih mengalir di pipinya yang merona, senyuman lebar yang tulus merekah di parasnya—bercahaya, berantakan, dan begitu memikat."

# game/week8.rpy:126
translate indonesian week8_start_4c8f4313:

    # n "Seeing that sudden, brilliant smile bloom right through their tears made your breath hitch, and your heart gave an unexpected, heavy thud against your ribs, skipping a beat entirely."
    n  "Melihat senyuman indah yang mendadak mekar menembus lelehan air matanya seketika membuat napasmu tertahan, dan jantungmu berdegup kencang menghantam tulang rusuk, berdetak tak keruan."

# game/week8.rpy:128
translate indonesian week8_start_159b5bf9:

    # n "Trida let out a shaky, half-laugh, scrubbing a messy sleeve across their face to wipe away the remaining tears while the wide grin stayed stubbornly plastered across their features."
    n  "Trida tertawa kecil seraya mengusapkan lengan baju hoodie-nya ke wajah untuk menghapus sisa air mata, sementara senyum lebarnya tetap terkembang manis di bibirnya."

# game/week8.rpy:130
translate indonesian week8_start_3a5e0d9a:

    # trida "Damn it... You're really not fair, you know that?"
    trida  "Sialan... Kamu bener-bener nggak adil tahu nggak?"

# game/week8.rpy:131
translate indonesian week8_start_b4bf7f98:

    # n "They whispered, their voice thick with emotion, but shining with a sudden, overwhelming lightness as they leaned into your shoulder."
    n  "Ia berbisik lirih, suaranya sarat oleh luapan emosi, namun kini bersinar dengan kelegaan yang begitu luar biasa saat ia menyandarkan tubuhnya ke bahumu."

# game/week8.rpy:132
translate indonesian week8_start_56621925:

    # trida "Nobody... nobody's ever said stuff like that to me before. Thank you. Seriously... thank you."
    trida  "Belum pernah... belum pernah ada orang yang ngomong hal seindah itu ke aku. Makasih banyak ya. Beneran... makasih banyak."

# game/week8.rpy:137
translate indonesian week8_start_d231ba51:

    # n "You didn't let go of the contact, keeping your hand steady against their arm and rubbing a reassuring thumb soothingly against their sleeve."
    n  "Kamu tidak melepaskan kontak hangat itu, mempertahankan tanganmu menggenggam lengannya dan mengusapkan ibu jarimu lembut menenangkan di atas kain bajunya."

# game/week8.rpy:138
translate indonesian week8_start_b2ed1505:

    # p "Are you actually, really... like really okay now?"
    p  "Sekarang kamu beneran... kayak beneran udah baikan?"

# game/week8.rpy:139
translate indonesian week8_start_d4174d1f:

    # n "You asked quietly, with a more protective register as you checked them over."
    n  "Tanyamu pelan dengan nada protektif seraya mengamati wajahnya dengan saksama."

# game/week8.rpy:140
translate indonesian week8_start_9a107668:

    # p "Your hands are still freezing. Should I give you some water? Just take a deep breath."
    p  "Tanganmu masih dingin banget begini. Perlu kuambilkan air minum hangat? Tarik napas dalam-dalam dulu ya."

# game/week8.rpy:142
translate indonesian week8_start_37e01240:

    # n "Trida let out another long breath, but this time, the tension visibly drained out of their rigid spine. The terrified edge in their eyes finally melted away and was replaced by warmth."
    n  "Trida menghembuskan napas panjang sekali lagi, namun kali ini seluruh ketegangan tampak meluruh sempurna dari punggungnya yang kaku. Kilat ketakutan di matanya akhirnya mencair seutuhnya, berganti binar kehangatan yang teduh."

# game/week8.rpy:143
translate indonesian week8_start_3b302750:

    # n "They let their head lean fully against your shoulder, resting there with a sense of complete, unguarded trust that they rarely, if ever, showed to anyone else."
    n  "Ia membiarkan kepalanya bersandar sepenuhnya di atas bahumu, merebah di sana dengan rasa percaya dan kenyamanan tanpa syarat yang jarang, atau bahkan belum pernah, ia perlihatkan kepada orang lain."

# game/week8.rpy:145
translate indonesian week8_start_7049a538:

    # n "For a few quiet moments, the only sound in the room was the steady hum of the air conditioner and the even rhythm of their breathing as it finally stabilised."
    n  "Untuk beberapa menit yang hening, satu-satunya suara di kamar itu hanyalah dengung stabil AC dan ritme tarikan napasnya yang perlahan kembali teratur."

# game/week8.rpy:148
translate indonesian week8_start_1d8c8653:

    # n "Then, a faint, familiar spark flickered back to life behind their tear-damp lashes."
    n  "Lalu, secercah kilau usil yang begitu familiar kembali menyala di balik bulu matanya yang masih basah oleh sisa air mata."

# game/week8.rpy:149
translate indonesian week8_start_e9efea72:

    # n "Trida shifted slightly, letting out a small, self-deprecating snort as a hint of their classic, overly dramatic flair crept back into their voice."
    n  "Trida bergerak sedikit, melepaskan dengusan tawa kecil seraya nada teatrikalnya yang khas perlahan merayap kembali ke suaranya."

# game/week8.rpy:151
translate indonesian week8_start_35722039:

    # trida "Man... look at you,"
    trida  "Duh... coba lihat dirimu,"

# game/week8.rpy:152
translate indonesian week8_start_3e1f5c67:

    # n "They mumbled, a soft, teasing edge finally weaving its way back into their tone."
    n  "Ia bergumam pelan, nada menggoda yang manis akhirnya kembali terdengar dalam intonasinya."

# game/week8.rpy:153
translate indonesian week8_start_d05944d1:

    # trida "Practically turning into a certified motivational speaker on a Saturday night. What's next, are you going to start giving out inspirational quote posters at the door?"
    trida  "Mendadak berubah jadi pembicara motivasi bersertifikat gini di malam Minggu. Habis ini apa lagi coba, kamu mau mulai bagi-bagi poster kutipan bijak di depan pintu kamar kos?"

# game/week8.rpy:155
translate indonesian week8_start_21bb1ff1:

    # n "Even though their voice was a little raspy from crying, the teasing jab was unmistakably {i}them{/i}."
    n  "Meski suaranya masih agak parau sehabis menangis, ledekan usil itu adalah tanda mutlak bahwa itu adalah {i}dirinya{/i}."

# game/week8.rpy:156
translate indonesian week8_start_03f0cda4:

    # n "It was the return of the Trida you knew—not hiding behind a loud, frantic mask this time, but sharing an intimate, quiet joke just between the two of you, sitting shoulder-to-shoulder in the dim light of your room."
    n  "Itu adalah kembalinya sosok Trida yang kamu kenal—bukan lagi bersembunyi di balik topeng keceriaan yang panik, melainkan berbagi lelucon intim yang sunyi hanya untuk kalian berdua, duduk berdampingan bahu-membahu di bawah temaramnya lampu kamarmu."
